<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Lam Soon, unit shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Lam Soon, unit shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd and its Lam Soon Food Industries Ltd subsidiary was suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the food processing group Lam Soon (Hong Kong) closed unchanged at HK$1.38 each on Friday. Lam Soon Food ended HK$0.03 lower at HK$0.67.</p>
<p>In January, Lam Soon (Hong Kong) and Lam Soon Food said they were considering proposals for a possible capital restructuring of the companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
